{"data":{"body":"[P2] Enforce the byte budget for empty arrays\n\nThis inserts scalar arrays without a final size check. Empty arrays never enter the loop\u2019s `fitsCandidate` branch, so many fields such as `{\"a\":[], ...}` can produce an arbitrarily large preview despite `maxPreviewBytes`, potentially exhausting memory before envelope encoding rejects it. Insert through `tryInsert` and add a regression covering empty arrays under a small budget.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ollmm","finding_digest":"56681df6a6b220d51afba4cc4c480b45f7dce97f05281934f556b8293868ad49","finding_id":"arf_v1_kzub35vgwiqnkgx3utgeysalix","finding_key":"serdes-preview::collect-visible-array::empty-array-budget-enforcement","identity_key":"serdes-preview::collect-visible-array::empty-array-budget-enforcement","line":280,"observation_digest":"3c3a51942f7101cd6daaca4c4d3e5ad96072c4fc7f29ec231e455dddbbbb818f","observation_id":"aro_v1_hq5fdfbpoea423nkzjge2ps23f","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T08:20:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7hk3zircn7jvv7a7j7twduz3hi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e8c9e1b514597f581acd43adf8039034437bb407","reviewer":"codex","start_line":280,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_s6orrihq6qlxx7jlpi6ory4wz5"},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_ngb6uox3z3y6m7w25kdhkfhezm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T08:20:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
